  "content": "<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Stein-N/resources/main/images/resource_backpacks/title_header.png\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Stein-N/resources/main/images/resource_backpacks/area_render.png\" width=\"1000\">\n\n## 又一款適用於Fabric、NeoForge和Forge的背包模組，提供更多儲物空間\n\nResource Backpacks專為主流模組加載器打造，致力於在各平台提供一致的遊戲體驗。\n\n### 特色功能\n- 透過遊戲內配置界面調整每個背包的容量大小（Fabric需安裝ModMenu）\n- 可像界伏盒般放置背包進行互動\n- 專屬裝備欄位可穿戴背包\n- 能將背包放置在盔甲架上\n- 殭屍與苦力怕有機率生成時自帶背包\n- 所有快捷鍵皆可自定義\n- 裝備背包時按`B`鍵即可開啟\n- 按住`左Shift`或`左Alt`預覽背包內容\n    - `左Shift`顯示物品堆疊總數的簡潔清單\n    - `左Alt`展示完整背包格位預覽\n\n### 模組包使用\n歡迎將本模組加入您的模組包，無需任何額外授權\n\n### 版本聲明\n因時間有限，目前僅積極維護1.21.1及最新小版本\n\n### 預覽畫面\n<details>\n<summary>物品提示與背包介面</summary>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Stein-N/resources/main/images/resource_backpacks/backpack_tooltip_preview.gif\" width=\"500\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Stein-N/resources/main/images/resource_backpacks/inventory/backpack_inventory.png\">\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>背包模型</summary>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Stein-N/resources/main/images/resource_backpacks/armor_stand_render.gif\" width=\"170\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Stein-N/resources/main/images/resource_backpacks/backpack_preview.gif\" width=\"150\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Stein-N/resources/main/images/resource_backpacks/player_preview.gif\" width=\"170\">\n</details>",
